Make direct tools/list, per-view registries, search/describe/call metadata, aggregated instructions, config tool browsing and notification recipients user/grant scoped. Eliminate startup-global tool surfaces and caches that can expose another owner's descriptions or schemas. Acceptance: two users with same names receive distinct schemas/instructions; unauthorized tools absent; helper metadata remains consistent with execution.
